1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:01,170
Clasp your hands.

2
00:00:01,170 --> 00:00:02,220
Don't think.

3
00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:03,767
Now put the OTHER thumb

4
00:00:03,767 --> 00:00:04,533
on top.

5
00:00:04,910 --> 00:00:06,070
Feels wrong, right?

6
00:00:06,070 --> 00:00:07,856
Every finger just moved...

7
00:00:07,856 --> 00:00:09,297
one seat over.

8
00:00:09,297 --> 00:00:10,220
Swap back.

9
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:11,842
Feel them all slide home?

10
00:00:11,842 --> 00:00:12,840
Swap again.

11
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:14,668
Everyone's next to...

12
00:00:14,668 --> 00:00:15,933
strangers.

13
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:17,280
So which way's normal?

14
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:17,940
Neither.

15
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:19,890
It's basically a coin toss.

16
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:22,208
Even identical twins,

17
00:00:22,208 --> 00:00:23,370
same DNA,

18
00:00:23,370 --> 00:00:24,820
pick different thumbs

19
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:27,167
four times in ten.

20
00:00:27,209 --> 00:00:27,889
So if you're praying

21
00:00:27,889 --> 00:00:29,200
for sunshine...

22
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:30,570
use your own thumb.

23
00:00:30,570 --> 00:00:32,171
Just in case.

